  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNIFEM programme goal is to achieve the implementation of         commitments to advance gender equality and women&apos;s empowerment in     Sudan. The overall development intervention cost is approximately 18  457 500 USD / 132 373 498 SEK. Other development partners include the UN family of agencies, Italy, Norway, and Canada.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNIFEM&apos;s program m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att uppn&#xe5; implementering av de &#xe5;taganden som  gjorts I Sudan f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och st&#xe4;rkande av kvinnor.  Den totala uppskattade program kostnaden &#xe4;r 18 457 500 USD/132 373    498 SEK. Andra samarbetspartners inkluderar FN familjen, Italien,     Norge och Kanada.</narrative>
  </description>
